WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.240
- You've taken both Barack
Obama and Will Ferrell

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:05.180
into the wild, which I think is awesome.

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:08.790
It's a grand scope or a
big kind of broad scale.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:13.336
So be honest, in an apocalypse
who would survive longer?

00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:14.717
- (chuckles) I don't know.

00:00:14.717 --> 00:00:17.920
I think I've learned that the
wild isn't about competition.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.860
It's not about who's better or stronger.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:22.730
I think if I've learned anything it's that

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.780
you've got to work together,

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:25.710
you've got to use your collective skills.

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:29.280
So I think, I mean hey
listen, Will Farrell,

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:32.420
there's no one with a
better sense of humor

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:36.360
who's kinder and humbler
than Will, you know,

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.770
when we were on that adventure.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:40.497
And a sense of humor really
matters when you're cold,

00:00:40.497 --> 00:00:42.562
and you're tired and
you're under pressure.

00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:43.395
- Yeah!

00:00:43.395 --> 00:00:45.460
- President Obama, I think he was,

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.810
he was resourceful, he was curious.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:49.370
He was really sort of determined

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:51.430
to go for things and try stuff.

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:54.191
So I think the combination
would be a killer team.

00:00:54.191 --> 00:00:56.170
- You are such a politician, I love it.

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:58.713
I love that answer. (laughs)

